# Regenerable state of the WP-15 postgres chain check: the trace, the seed and the 66 MB snapshot
# come back from `spec.json`/`manifest.json` plus the harness's seed, so they are not committed. The
# evidence IS committed: manifest.json, spec.json, loadavg.jsonl, machine-state.jsonl,
# windows-postgres.jsonl, run-postgres.json, run-postgres-full.json, instance-build.json,
# postgres-server.jsonl, pg-server.log, pg-server-peak.json, scoreboard.md and snapshot/*.json
# (the digest and its size).
trace.jsonl
seed.jsonl
**/snapshot/*
!**/snapshot/*.json
**/live/
**/pg/
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
